This experiment develops a Policy Compliance Agent that evaluates synthetic employee data against predefined policy rules. The system identifies policy violations, determines whether each employee is COMPLIANT or NON-COMPLIANT, and uses Ollama to generate a concise compliance report.

Technologies: Python, Ollama, Llama 3.2, Rule-Based Evaluation, Synthetic Data

Workflow:
Synthetic Data → Policy Rules → Rule-Based Evaluation → Compliance Status → AI Compliance Report

Example:

Employee B has a password shorter than 8 characters and does not have MFA enabled.

The system detects these violations using predefined rules and classifies the employee as NON-COMPLIANT, then generates a compliance report with recommended actions.
